{
  "info": {
    "name": "AutoLead API",
    "description": "AutoLead backend — used-car brokerage API.\n\n**Auth:** email + password. JWT is identity only; live roles come from `user_roles` on each request.\n\n**Staff routes** require Bearer + Admin role. **Owner routes** require Bearer + Admin or Salesperson (deactivate is Admin-only). **Catalog, Vehicles, Leads, Notifications** accept Admin or Salesperson; lead assignment, vehicle status changes, and media/document deletes are Admin-only. A salesperson only sees leads assigned to them.\n\nError envelope: `{ \"error\": { \"code\": string, \"message\": string } }`\nPagination: `limit` default 20 max 100; `offset` default 0; page `{ items, total, limit, offset }`.\n\nFlow: Login → create owner → pick catalog variant → create vehicle → create lead → associate vehicle → assign lead → schedule follow-up → change status → inbox.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.test('Response time under 5s', function () {",
          "  pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(5000);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
