            "description": "Returns the authenticated user's profile and live roles.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer token required.\n\n**200** — Profile returned successfully.\n\n**401** — Missing or invalid token (`AUTHENTICATION_FAILED`).\n\n**404** — Token valid but user record no longer exists (`NOT_FOUND`).\n\n**503** — Database unavailable (`DB_UNAVAILABLE`). Previously caused by an ambiguous PostgREST FK embed on `user_roles → users`; fixed by disambiguating with `users!user_id!inner(deleted_at)`."
          },
