        {
          "name": "Change Vehicle Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"dropped\",\n  \"reason\": \"owner withdrew\",\n  \"confirmUnlinkLeads\": false\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/status",
            "description": "POST /vehicles/:id/status (Admin) — 200 `{ status, unlinkedLeadCount }`. Only `dropped` and `open` (re-list) are accepted; `linked` / `sold` follow the vehicle's leads → 422 VEHICLE_STATUS_SYSTEM_MANAGED. Graph: open ⇄ linked (auto), linked → sold (auto, lead converts), open/linked → dropped, dropped → open. Dropping a vehicle with active leads → 422 VEHICLE_HAS_LINKED_LEADS with `error.details.linkedLeadCount`; resend with `confirmUnlinkLeads: true` to unlink those leads and drop it."
          }
